                <span class="op-tool-icon"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20 2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v18l4-4h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2z"/></svg> 公告中心</span>
